1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:03,081
Poora advance diya, aur developer ghayab?

2
00:00:03,286 --> 00:00:07,295
Sana ne apni boutique ki app, sirf ek phone call pe de di.

3
00:00:07,285 --> 00:00:09,662
Na likha hua scope, na koi date.

4
00:00:10,136 --> 00:00:13,730
Teen mahine baad jawab aaya: bas do din aur, bhai.

5
00:00:13,817 --> 00:00:16,783
Kaam dene se pehle, ye teen cheezein maango.

6
00:00:16,974 --> 00:00:21,515
Pehli: zubaani nahi, likh kar. Scope, milestones, aur fixed price.

7
00:00:21,711 --> 00:00:25,422
Doosri: poora advance nahi. Har milestone pe payment.

8
00:00:25,926 --> 00:00:29,923
Teesri: har hafte chalta hua demo. Slides nahi, asli app.

9
00:00:30,128 --> 00:00:33,186
Yaad rakho: andaaza nahi, likha hua plan.

10
00:00:33,298 --> 00:00:37,201
Save karo, aur us dost ko bhejo jo app banwa raha hai.

11
00:00:37,501 --> 00:00:41,673
Localhost Labs pe pehli call free hai. Follow karo, DM karo.
